{"parse":{"title":"特性/巨角牦牛","pageid":8049,"revid":19710,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>巨角牦牛</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.B7.A8.E8.A7.92.E7.89.A6.E7.89.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"巨角牦牛\"><b>巨角牦牛</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 巨角牦牛.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6b/2xdwwawpa4gi13ykcun1w7aj8xx5zhm.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6b/2xdwwawpa4gi13ykcun1w7aj8xx5zhm.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6b/2xdwwawpa4gi13ykcun1w7aj8xx5zhm.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />巨角牦牛\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦拥有<font color=\"#58cb48\">70%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命阈值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">生命阈值</font></span></span>]，触发后受到<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">背击</span>]，或<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合后解除。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">疯血乱袭</span>]光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内友军被攻击时，若其生命值低于<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>且自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内存在<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名及以上敌人，则进行反击，造成其范围内敌人<font color=\"#d68fe2\">100%</font>魔法伤害；若有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，则额外造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>魔法伤害，击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。<br />✦被非近战攻击时，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">55%</font>。<br />✦行动后可再移动<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格。拥有落水救星，触发时损失<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>生命值。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">55%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/巨角牦牛\"><img alt=\"巨角牦牛 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d1/p68hl7y0aqekbfj6wmv4b6cdfjzidro.png/75px-%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d1/p68hl7y0aqekbfj6wmv4b6cdfjzidro.png/113px-%E5%B7%A8%E8%A7%92%E7%89%A6%E7%89%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d1/p68hl7y0aqekbfj6wmv4b6cdfjzidro.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164221\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14266/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4400/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   89.278      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   89.278      1 -total\n 59.66%   53.260      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 53.17%   47.471      6 模板:中括号介绍\n 11.71%   10.456      1 模板:面包屑\n  5.81%    5.185      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8049-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164221 and revision id 19710. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_巨角牦牛.png","巨角牦牛_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>巨角牦牛</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"巨角牦牛"}],"displaytitle":"特性/巨角牦牛","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=巨角牦牛\n|特性名称=巨角牦牛\n|特性图标=巨角牦牛\n|特性描述=✦拥有<font color=#58cb48>70%</font>[<font color=#f3c156>生命阈值</font>]，触发后受到<font color=#ed7950>3</font>次[背击]，或<font color=#ed7950>2</font>回合后解除。<br>✦拥有[疯血乱袭]光环，效果：自身范围<font color=#ed7950>5</font>格内友军被攻击时，若其生命值低于<font color=#ed7950>70%</font>且自身范围<font color=#ed7950>1</font>格内存在<font color=#ed7950>2</font>名及以上敌人，则进行反击，造成其范围内敌人<font color=#d68fe2>100%</font>魔法伤害；若有[自然守护]，则额外造成<font color=#d68fe2>50%</font>魔法伤害，击退<font color=#ed7950>1</font>格，施加[<font color=#f3c156>▼移动</font>]（持续2回合）。<br>✦被非近战攻击时，最终受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>55%</font>。<br>✦行动后可再移动<font color=#ed7950>5</font>格。拥有落水救星，触发时损失<font color=#ed7950>20%</font>生命值。<br>拥有[<font color=#f3c156>自然守护</font>]，效果：<br>✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>55%</font>。\n}}"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:21.863705+00:00"}